    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当人性的深渊被骤然撕裂，从温情脉脉到血肉模糊的蜕变轨迹，一场蓄谋已久的血腥清算，让破碎的灵魂在疯狂与绝望中走向永恒的黑暗。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl_aaKAVrMStfxdEmxR9MU5Lbcox.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（王志健被捕）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuNS3l_m56ofASIPwKdJ9rAYCC7j.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（王志健背后纹身）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmdvZbuzLDjh4OfnkX-P0RQns53Y.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（王志健面露微笑）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrWUUaAs5JKvyTZCQXh-I79-WUP3.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（受害者陪读妈妈母女）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpQ38iyECwy8DmUlxFvtxbczr9lL.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（作案凶器）</span></p><span></span><p><span>资料来源（文字版权归属作者）：</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易</span></p><span></span><p><span>作者：谈史论天地</span></p><span></span><p><span>《新加坡陪读妈妈囚禁情人当性奴，结果4女一夜被砍133刀，3死1重伤》</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://m.163.com/dy/article/JVUF5JEA05562MJC.html" data-url="https://m.163.com/dy/article/JVUF5JEA05562MJC.html"><span>m.163.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>《新加坡陪读妈妈圈养性奴，后惨遭杀害，凶手：她生理期都不放过我》</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://m.163.com/dy/article/JVO57PD605562MJC.html" data-url="https://m.163.com/dy/article/JVO57PD605562MJC.html"><span>m.163.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>作者：花花史界</span></p><span></span><p><span>《新加坡陪读妈妈囚禁情人，4女一夜遭反杀》</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.163.com/dy/article/K2RLJE9K055656W5_pdya11y.html" data-url="https://www.163.com/dy/article/K2RLJE9K055656W5_pdya11y.html"><span>www.163.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>作者：史记趣闻</span></p><span></span><p><span>《狮城奇案：囚禁、虐待、摧残，一男三女的爱恨纠葛》</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.163.com/dy/article/K2J6FK4N05566LU8.html?spss=wap2pc" data-url="https://www.163.com/dy/article/K2J6FK4N05566LU8.html?spss=wap2pc"><span>www.163.com</span></a></p><span></span><